From f8e9c255ef29f0eb9ca0ea218b3040833eb6eda6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: timfox <timfox@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:48:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] gamecube: record the uncommitted GameCube game-code
 edits

Snapshot of the GameCube work that only existed as uncommitted edits in
this checkout: lean HUD/input, lean New Game spawn paths (static actors,
weapons, effects, sound, nodes), player and gamerules hooks, and the
GameCube waf cross-compile support. No functional change in this commit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
